<title>USA: Winn-Dixie Stores Inc monthly div $0.08.</title>
<headline>Winn-Dixie Stores Inc monthly div $0.08.</headline>
<dateline>JACKSONVILLE, Fla. 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Winn-Dixie Stores Inc set a regular monthly dividend of $0.08 per share on its common stock for three months on Thursday.</p>
<p>The dividend, same as the previous amount, is payable Feb 3, March 3 and April 1 to shareholders of record at the close of business Jan 15, Feb 14 and March 14.</p>
</text>
